  "Incident Details is sampled every 5 minutes during weekday rush hours and every 45 minutes otherwise, to stay inside TomTom's 2,500/month allowance. The onset figure is therefore weighted toward rush hour: it is closer to 'how long a rush-hour incident takes to become a jam' than to a figure for all hours equally. Off-peak episodes shorter than 45 minutes can be missed entirely.",
